### Features

* stats

### Running sessions

* nothing to do

## [0.3.1](https://example.com/compare/v0.3.0...v0.3.1) (2026-10-15)

### Bug Fixes

* a fix

### Running sessions

* resume each root after sync

## [0.3.0] (2026-10-10)

